      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sadly for presubmit it is needed to use cuttlefish, while this test must use physical device. So this test cannot fits presumit.\nRef: go/test-mapping-mainline-user-guide#limitations-and-known-issues\n\nAlternatively, if cuttlefish supports multiple device test, it would be perfect.\nBut again I don\u0027t see it is documented anywhere.\nRef: https://source.android.com/docs/setup/create/cuttlefish-connectivity#example\n\nGiven that it is not feasible to put this in presubmit.\nI refactor it to maximize the coverage for both cell/wifi upstream.\nWe can disable any of it if we preferred.\nSee if works for you.",
